WEBVTT

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.030
<i>Since I got a message from Taiga asking me to come over,</i>

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.220
<i>I came right over, being the nice person I am.</i>

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:13.780
Illya!

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:16.590
Welcome!

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.420
Hey, Taiga. Is there something going on today?

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.430
Illya, don't ask any questions.
I just want you to go change clothes.

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.090
Hey, Taiga...

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:34.220
What's up with this?

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:37.170
I'd really like an explanation.

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:41.170
Ms. Taiga, thanks for waiting.

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.480
We're all done now.

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:48.860
Hey, Taiga...

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:50.820
This is...

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:55.890
Yes! Yes!

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:59.090
As your elder, I approve!

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:01.710
R-Really?

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:04.190
All righty.

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:07.680
Now that you're all set to go,
Illya, why don't we head over?

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:09.730
Head over? Where?

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:14.010
Oh, I wouldn't want to spoil the surprise!

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:19.460
I've been waiting for you, Illyasviel.

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:22.020
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:23.490
Saber?

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.680
Oh, you look gorgeous.

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:30.410
It will only be for a short time,
but I'm honored to escort you.

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:33.040
Now, then, please give me your hand.

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:46.140
Welcome, Illya!

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.490
Oh, my, how lovely!

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:52.770
Hey, but this is Shirou's house.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.270
And you're here, too, Sakura and Rin.

00:02:56.310 --> 00:02:59.040
I knew it! You're plotting something, aren't you?

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:00.580
Now, now...

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:03.560
The insinuation!

00:03:04.090 --> 00:03:07.240
Rin's just reaping what she sows, isn't she?

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.160
This is the living room.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.210
Hey, Illya...

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:17.530
Do you know what today is?

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:19.800
Today?

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:41.100
March 3 is Girls' Day, the Doll's Festival!

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:46.980
We celebrate it to pray that our young
girls will grow up to be healthy and happy.

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:50.160
They're so tiny, yet so elaborate!

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:52.120
They're called "Hina dolls."

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:53.930
I was just thinking,

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:58.800
it wouldn't be a bad idea to have
you experience Japanese culture!

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.450
Just a little whim of mine!

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:05.030
And guess who jumped on the bandwagon? All of us.

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:06.640
Shirou!

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:13.360
Still, I'm not sure if I belong
here in this all-girl dimension.

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:15.610
Oh, come on! Isn't it a little late for that?

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:17.820
Never mind that, is it done yet?

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:21.260
Yeah, ready to go!

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:27.240
Illya, we all made this together.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.660
We just hope you like it.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:37.980
So you see!

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:41.630
I have a lot of prepping to do, so I'll be going on ahead!

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:46.500
Saber, have her come to my place later, like we planned!

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:49.590
Roger that!

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:54.640
This is kind of fun, isn't it?

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:57.010
I wonder if Illya will be surprised?

00:04:57.390 --> 00:05:00.640
Oh, so you're the type who gets
all fired up about these things, huh?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.040
Do you dislike these things, Rin?

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:06.210
N-No.

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:09.010
I guess I find it fun, too.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:14.550
Um, okay, I'm glad to hear that!

00:05:17.140 --> 00:05:19.980
Um, I think I'll start setting out the decorations!

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:22.050
Right! I'm counting on you!

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.690
Sakura, I'll help out, too.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:30.800
I'll be standing by until it's time, all right?

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:32.920
Yeah, I'll leave that to you!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:38.730
All right.

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:42.440
Guess I'll get started, too!

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:48.940
First, after rinsing the rice, you put
it in a strainer and drain the water out.

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:56.340
Then slice your carrots, lotus root,
bamboo shoots and rehydrated shiitake.

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:58.480
And soak the lotus root in water.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:03.670
Now, put everything you just sliced into
your rice cooker along with the rinsed rice.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:06.980
Add a little less than the water-level marker.

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:08.440
Then for seasoning,

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:13.980
add soy sauce, sake, mirin, and the
dashi liquid from the dried shiitake.

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:17.690
Normally, you'd boil the ingredients separately,

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.490
but today I'm doing it the easy way, with the rice cooker.

00:06:22.890 --> 00:06:24.600
Next, the kinshi egg.

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:29.050
Mix the eggs, season them with salt and sugar,

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:32.250
then strain them to make a thin egg crepe.

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:37.280
Julienne the eggs and your kinshi tamago is done.

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:40.500
Bring the snow peas, strings removed,

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:45.630
and the carrots and lotus root you'll be
using for garnish to a quick boil in salted water,

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.480
then cool them off in a bowl of water.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:53.760
Add sake to this pot and heat the shrimp.
Then marinate them in sushi vinegar.

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:56.730
What a lovely smell.

00:06:58.970 --> 00:06:59.800
Saber?

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:03.370
I thought there might be something I could do to help.

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:05.140
Oh, I'll be fine.

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:09.770
All right, why don't you head out now to pick up Illya?

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:11.860
Right! You can count on me!

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:18.250
When the rice is done, pour the sushi
vinegar, minus the shrimp, over it all.

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:21.750
Then mix the rice in a vertical chopping motion.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:26.700
When your rice scoop starts
to feel heavier as you're mixing,

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:30.560
stop mixing, then cool it off by fanning it.

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:37.390
From time to time, flip your
rice over to expose the hot parts.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:41.930
Cooling it all off at once gives the sushi rice a nice sheen.

00:07:44.390 --> 00:07:46.270
Sakura? You ready?

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:48.880
Oh, is it my turn now?

00:07:49.390 --> 00:07:55.040
Yeah, if you don't mind.

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:58.940
Please leave it to me, Senpai!

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:01.200
There's something I've been wanting to try!

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:15.040
Hey, Emiya...

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:22.620
I'd like to use the kitchen for a bit, too.

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:57.210
So you see, this chirashizushi is
a joint effort by Sakura and me.

00:08:57.570 --> 00:09:01.420
It never occurred to me to make something like this.

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:04.130
And it was Tohsaka who made this.

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:07.670
I'm surprised.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:09.670
Yes, for sure.

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:12.730
Never a good idea to do
something you're not used to doing!

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:15.540
I just got swept up into this, as well...

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:18.180
Or should I say, it was like I got swayed.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:22.510
Oh, really! Never mind me!

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:24.180
Come on! Let's eat!

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.820
All right, I think I'm gonna dig in!

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:46.500
Thank you for the meal!

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:51.480
Oh, my. The lotus root and carrots are flower-shaped.

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:53.410
Exquisite!

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:57.570
Today's meal is the result of
more meticulous work than usual!

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:02.170
Hey, Shirou! This is amazake, right?

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:04.930
Isn't there any shirozake? Shirozake!

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:08.150
Fuji-nee, just live with that today, will you?

00:10:08.430 --> 00:10:13.270
Making flowers from raw salmon... What a great idea!

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:16.880
Illya?

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:22.680
Trying to surprise me...
You do have a lot of nerve, don't you?

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.180
No, but...

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:32.680
I guess these boisterous events aren't bad, either.

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:35.080
Is that right?

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:39.690
Forget that! Hey, Shirou,

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:43.620
I still haven't heard your comments
about how I look in this outfit!

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.550
Well, of course, I think you look cute—

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:49.630
Thank you, Big Brother!

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:51.180
Hey, hold up!

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:52.490
Illyasviel!
